OL,3,GNEWSACouncil's nursery closures
OL,4,Adecision 'devastating'
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents have said a council's decision
OL,7,Fto close 10 publicly-run nurseries is
OL,8,F"devastating".
OL,10,FSouth Tyneside Council confirmed it
OL,11,Fwill close the South Tyneside
OL,12,FAccredited Network for Learning in the
OL,13,FEarly Years (Stanley's) nurseries.
OL,15,FThe decision was made by councillors
OL,16,Fduring a cabinet meeting at South
OL,17,FShields Town Hall during which shouts
OL,18,Fof "shame" were heard from the public
OL,19,Fgallery, where a number of nursery
OL,20,Fworkers and parents had gathered.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
